meta {
  name: 04_DiscoveryAndValidation
  seq: 4
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  Scenario: The discovery endpoints describe each area, and queries outside an area are rejected

    When anyone reads the filter fields of each area without a token
    Then each area lists exactly the fields it offers
    When anyone reads the activity types of each area without a token
    Then each area lists only its own catalog entries, in the requested language
    Given a call without a token to the log
    Then it is rejected with 401
    Given a delegator reading its own connections log
    Then an unknown activity type id is rejected with 400
    And an activity type from another area is rejected with 400
    And a type outside the area is rejected with 400
    And an unknown filter field is rejected with 400
    And a filter field outside the area is rejected with 400
    And a query without a direction is refused with 403
}
